      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Are you saying that all test builds are disappearing from that tab? The usual problem I have with VRChat and build and test is that it doesn't pick up new files all that fast. \n\nSDK gets the filename from the name of the object that contains the avatar descriptor. I've seen some issues with certain character in the object name, so I make sure the object name is fairly boring, alpha numeric.\n\nThe other problem I've observed is that if I'm in a test avatar, I need to change out of it for a few seconds before VRChat let's go of the file. If an avatar fails to load, and reverts to what avatar I'm wearing properly, I know I have to build and test again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
