      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: Sorry for not responding a few weeks earlier.\n\nNot all test builds disappear, only the ones built under a different account signed into the SDK. For example, if I'm signed in to VR Chat on Account_A, any test avatars built under Account_A appear, but if I build a test avatar with a client's account signed in on the SDK, let's say Account_B, it doesn't appear if I'm signed in on Account_A in VR Chat.",
